  "title": "Implement agent-runner.py Integration Hooks",
  "description": "Implement integration hooks that connect the agent SDK to the existing `agent-runner.py` two-commit protocol. The SDK manages ticket state via MCP while `agent-runner.py` continues to handle git operations (git add, git commit, git push). Provide hook points: `pre_claim()`, `post_claim()`, `pre_commit()`, `post_commit()` that `agent-runner.py` can call at appropriate lifecycle stages.",
